---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Home">
  <div class="hero-section">
    <h1>Senior Technical Leader &amp; Software/AI Architect</h1>

    <p>I'm a senior technical leader with <strong>13+ years of experience</strong> solving complex problems at the intersection of <strong>technology, people, and business strategy</strong>.</p>

    <div class="hero-tagline">
      Transforming Business Challenges into Innovative Technical Solutions
    </div>
  </div>

  <hr />

  <h2>What I Do</h2>

  <p>My experience allows me to operate effectively at any level:</p>

  <h3>🏗️ As an Architect</h3>
  <p>I design <strong>scalable, modular, and business-focused architectures</strong> for cloud, data, and AI systems. I specialize in:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>AI Architecture</strong> and LLM implementation in enterprise environments</li>
    <li><strong>MLOps</strong> and Agent AI solutions</li>
    <li>Cloud-native systems (AWS, GCP)</li>
    <li>Distributed systems and microservices</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>👥 As a Leader</h3>
  <p>I focus on <strong>team efficiency and management</strong>, building and mentoring high-performing teams that ship high-quality code. My leadership approach combines:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Technical mentorship and growth</li>
    <li>Agile team management</li>
    <li>Cross-functional collaboration</li>
    <li>Engineering culture development</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>🎯 As a Strategist</h3>
  <p>I use my <strong>business analysis background</strong> to ensure technical roadmaps are perfectly aligned with business goals:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Strategic technical planning</li>
    <li>Business value optimization</li>
    <li>Risk assessment and mitigation</li>
    <li>Technology evaluation and selection</li>
  </ul>

  <hr />

  <h2>Featured Expertise</h2>

  <div class="expertise-grid">
    <div class="expertise-card">
      <h3>AI &amp; Machine Learning</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>LLM Integration &amp; Implementation</li>
        <li>Agent AI Systems</li>
        <li>MLOps &amp; Model Deployment</li>
        <li>Custom AI Solutions</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="expertise-card">
      <h3>Cloud Architecture</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>AWS &amp; GCP Solutions</li>
        <li>Serverless Architectures</li>
        <li>Infrastructure as Code</li>
        <li>Cost Optimization (FinOps)</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="expertise-card">
      <h3>Data Engineering</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Big Data Pipelines</li>
        <li>Real-time Streaming</li>
        <li>Data Warehouse Design</li>
        <li>Analytics Platforms</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="expertise-card">
      <h3>Software Engineering</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Distributed Systems</li>
        <li>Microservices Architecture</li>
        <li>DDD, CQRS, Event Sourcing</li>
        <li>Full-Stack Development</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <hr />

  <h2>Why Work With Me?</h2>

  <p>I'm passionate about <strong>driving technical excellence</strong> and <strong>building a positive engineering culture</strong>. If you're tackling a complex challenge, let's connect.</p>

  <div class="cta-section">
    <h3>Ready to Unlock the Power of Data &amp; AI?</h3>

    <a href="/services" class="btn-primary">Explore My Services</a>
    <a href="/portfolio" class="btn-secondary">View Portfolio</a>
    <a href="/blog" class="btn-secondary">Read My Blog</a>

    <p><strong>Book a free 30-minute consultation</strong> - <a href="/about#contact">Get in touch</a></p>
  </div>

  <hr />

  <h2>Quick Stats</h2>

  <ul>
    <li><strong>13+ years</strong> of technical leadership experience</li>
    <li><strong>AI &amp; LLM</strong> implementation specialist</li>
    <li><strong>Cloud-native</strong> architecture expert (AWS, GCP)</li>
    <li><strong>Multiple industries</strong>: FinTech, Healthcare, Media, Gaming, Supply Chain</li>
    <li><strong>Languages</strong>: Python, Rust, TypeScript/JavaScript, Go</li>
    <li><strong>Team leadership</strong>: From startups to enterprise</li>
  </ul>

  <hr />

  <div class="recent-highlights">
    <h2>Recent Highlights</h2>

    <p><strong>AI Consultant @ Heliux</strong> (2023 - Present)</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Developed AI solutions for supply chain and product management</li>
      <li>Integrated LLMs, agents, and custom integrations</li>
      <li>Led AWS infrastructure design and CI/CD implementation</li>
    </ul>

    <p><strong>Tech Lead @ MasterBorn</strong> (2020 - 2022)</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Led development of political document archiving platform with NLP</li>
