      <li>Designed document analysis platform for FinTech</li>
    </ul>

    <p><strong>Consultant @ Order of Devs</strong> (2018 - Present)</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Facilitated Event Storming workshops for UK startups</li>
      <li>Led cloud migration for Canal+ using AWS, Spark, and Snowflake</li>
      <li>Architected platform for car detection in NYC with image/video processing</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <hr />

  <div class="testimonial-section">
    <h2>Let's Build Something Extraordinary</h2>

    <p>Whether you need an AI strategy, cloud architecture, or a technical leader to guide your team, I bring the expertise and passion to make it happen.</p>

    <a href="/about#contact" class="btn-primary">Contact Me Today</a>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
